        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 461121, Monolithic Entry Door Handleset with San Carlos Grip</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Monolithic Handleset with San Carlos Grip has a rustic look that will make it a great addition to any traditional home. It recalls historic designs in a way that is in step with contemporary design aesthetics. The Monolithic Handleset with San Carlos Grip is available in satin steel and flat black steel finishes, both of which have a slightly textured surface. This Monolithic Entry Door Handleset with San Carlos Grip is available as a dummy function or a single cylinder function. This old world handleset will fit either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and can accommodate doors from 1-3/4 inches to 3 inches thick.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Wrought Steel Tubular Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li> \r\n<li>UL 180 minute fire rating</li>\r\n<li>Hardened steel bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Emtek Monolithic Entrance Handleset with Twisted Grip:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Wrought Steel</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Height: 19\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Width: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Clearance: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Thickness: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Height: 9-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Width: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Distance between Deadbolt and Lever Latch: 5-1/2\" c.c.</li>\r\n<li>Distance between Latch Bore to Bottom Mounting Hole: 9-7/16\" c.c.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-461121-specifications.pdf?v=1704262346\"><b>Emtek 461121 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-Handle-B-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262345\"><b>Emtek Tubular Entryset Template Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-461121-finish.jpg?v=1704354656\" width=\"351\" height=\"184\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Monolithic Handleset with San Carlos Grip",
                "description": "The Monolithic Handleset with San Carlos Grip has a rustic look that will make it a great addition to any traditional home. It recalls historic designs in a way that is in step with contemporary design aesthetics. The Monolithic Handleset with San Carlos Grip is available in satin steel and flat black steel finishes, both of which have a slightly textured surface. This Monolithic Entry Door Handleset with San Carlos Grip is available as a dummy function or a single cylinder function. This old world handleset will fit either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and can accommodate doors from 1-3/4 inches to 3 inches thick.\r\n",
